# E2 FB, round 1 of 5: voice alone, the frozen box and the PRs' 48-token configuration on the final code, with
# W5's arm files, every call opening with a warm-up turn and no KV sampler, as W5's points ran. Round N replays
# w5-rN's sample of the agents (seed 10 + N) and runs the three in an order rotated by one from round to round,
# so that FB compares with W5 round by round.
#   benchmarks/e2/campaign.sh benchmarks/e2/fb-r1.campaign

agents-seed 11
kv-sample-s 0

# engine frozen
arms/w5-a1-voice.toml
arms/w5-disc-frozen-s24.toml

# engine make-room --additional-config.make_room.reserve_tokens 0 --additional-config.make_room.budget_cap_tokens 48
arms/w5-disc-pr-ab48-s24.toml
